msgid "Mode, onion state, distro and filesystem are assigned by the rotation over the sweep number, and a retrigger is a new run with a new number (``call-orchestrator.yml`` falls back to ``github.run_number``). Comparing the full deploy tokens therefore compares two different sweeps: measured against the current ranking, 2 of 277 rows matched, so every walk stopped on its first row and the regular line never left the head. The row is the coarsest identity the rotation cannot move."
